      "_id": "D1rp90l2hL7gn5vY",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Included with the MgT2e system are a number of macros. These are provided as part of the <em><strong>MgT2e Base Macros</strong></em> compendium. They can be executed directly from the compendium, or dragged onto the world.</p><p>The more common ones can be placed on the hotbar.</p><p></p>"
      },
