      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Trivial macro for rolling 1D6 to the chat. It is mosty useful for putting on the hotbar, then you can roll 1D6 with a single click or button press.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.mgt2e.base-macros.Macro.c0VzdYaCOk0lsx9W]{1D6}</p>"
