    {
      "sort": 400000,
      "name": "D66",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "LazeZpSLwLqoqaYP",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Roll D66 to the chat. This does /r 1D6 * 10 + 1D6, giving a result between 11 and 66. A number of tables in Traveller use D66, so this might be easier than typing it each time. As for the 1D6 and 2D6 macros, putting it on the hotbar provides a quick way of rolling it.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.mgt2e.base-macros.Macro.pBJCMW5TZAb9pmuw]{D66}</p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
