    {
      "sort": 500000,
      "name": "Add Effect Status",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "qQCaa2kkDIPohHIO",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>This macro is designed to quickly add an effect status to a token. Select one or more tokens, and execute this. You will be given a drop down list of effects to select from.</p><p>Why would you want to use this rather than the normal token UI? This way adds some MgT2e specific meta data to the status, and can be applied to multiple tokens at once.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.mgt2e.base-macros.Macro.kG3Mn6wTvnf2ENOy]{Add Effect Status}</p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "category": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
        "mhUjqDVicnwIUaiq": 3
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
