      "name": "Create NPC",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "SeHCDutL0XSAQOdt",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Example macro to create a random NPC. See the @UUID[Compendium.mgt2e.traveller-docs.JournalEntry.dzoWvMqYL6UGTXO6]{NPC Generator} documentation for how this works. Executing this macro as-is will create a random NPC.</p><p>NPCs are created with a random name, background and set of skills.</p><p>This macro is designed to be modified and extended in order to tailor it for the types of NPCs that you want to create.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.mgt2e.base-macros.Macro.syDZckLCMGZ8qxIe]{Create NPC}</p>"
      },
