    {
      "sort": 1300000,
      "name": "Mirror Tokens",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "VSif3rZpPVmGTjYO",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Flips tokens to rotate them 180°. The orientation of spacecraft and vehicle tokens included with the system were rotated 180° in version 0.23.3. Previously tokens had been drawn facing 'up', to match the common style for spacecraft and vehicles in SF.</p><p>Foundry though assumes tokens face 'down', and the auto-rotate option has everything moving backwards if this orientation isn't used. So the token graphics for vehicles and spacecraft have been flipped to match the Foundry style.</p><p>This means any tokens on scenes would be rotated. In order to provide an easy fix, this macro allows you to select any number of tokens, and executing it will flip them around.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.mgt2e.base-macros.Macro.2Js9q4zwUd7rL5HS]{Mirror Tokens}</p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "category": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
        "mhUjqDVicnwIUaiq": 3
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
        "compendiumSource": null,
        "duplicateSource": null,
        "exportSource": null,
        "coreVersion": "13.351",
        "systemId": "mgt2e",
        "systemVersion": "0.23.3.4-DEV",
        "createdTime": 1792853601516,
        "modifiedTime": 1792854024802,
        "lastModifiedBy": "mhUjqDVicnwIUaiq"
      },
      "_key": "!journal.pages!f61FiaIEjs2FbDRw.VSif3rZpPVmGTjYO"
    },
    {
      "sort": 1400000,
      "name": "Recover PSI",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "28XK8E1bmGTscAWq",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Similar to the Heal macro, this just resets PSI points back to maximum. Can be used as an example of how to heal a specific characteristic.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.mgt2e.base-macros.Macro.6gkHw0riniG3Nrf1]{Recover PSI}</p>"
