    {
      "sort": 1700000,
      "name": "Skill Request",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "5kgkga7Ep0ZTBrMS",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Allows the GM (or another player) to make a skill roll request and put it into the chat. They can specify the target difficulty, skill required, and some text for the purpose of the roll and also success and failure messages.</p><p>Useful for when the GM wants all players to make a skill check for their character. A chat message is generated, and each player can simply click the button to roll for their character.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.mgt2e.base-macros.Macro.6biNYKza2rPgNzGF]{Skill Request}</p>"
      },
